# Build artifacts and generated files for the Rust MarkItDown suite.
# Source, Cargo.lock (committed on purpose for the binary/app workspace),
# READMEs, the skill and the python-engine build scripts ARE tracked.

# --- Rust ---
# Workspace + Tauri build outputs (the desktop app uses its own target dir).
target/
**/*.rs.bk
# Coverage / profiling
*.profraw

# --- Node / Tauri frontend (desktop/) ---
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
# Tauri's generated platform projects and bundles
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/target/

# --- Optional Python fallback engine (python-engine/) ---
# Everything PyInstaller and the venv produce; the .sh/.ps1 scripts stay.
.venv/
build/
dist/
__pycache__/
*.spec
_entry.py
markitdown-py.spec

# --- Editors / OS ---
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
*.log

# --- Scratch output (smoke.sh now uses a temp dir; this is belt-and-suspenders
#     in case a script or manual command is run from inside app/) ---
formats.txt
conv_out.md
mcp_req.txt
mcp_resp.txt
